        <title>creditor_agents</title>
        <link>https://resolutionbazaar.com/doku.php?id=talk:creditors:creditor_agents&amp;rev=1743696627&amp;do=diff</link>
        <description>Games Claimants Play

In an insolvency resolution process, claimants—including financial and operational creditors, trade creditors, employees, and other stakeholders with claims against the corporate debtor—can sometimes engage in manipulative tactics to increase their recoveries or influence the resolution outcome in their favor. Here are some common</description>
